" export says so: the buoyancy system Gazebo Harmonic has measures a mesh "
"without its scale, which would buoy PartCAD's millimetre meshes by a "
"billion times their volume, and a world that names any system of its own "
"loses all of Gazebo's default ones. A Gazebo run of a scene filled with "
"water is a run in a vacuum."
