"written for looking at is not one written for running: by default each "
"exporter welds every body to the world, because a scene on its own states"
" where things are, and a simulation asks the export for the opposite. "
"What each format keeps, and every export parameter, is documented in the "
"plugin's repository, including the parts of MJCF that are easy to get "
"wrong (angles are degrees by default, an orientation has five spellings, "
"and a box's ``size`` is its half-extents)."
