#~ msgid ""
#~ "MuJoCo reads MJCF and no other "
#~ "model format, so a Gazebo world it"
#~ " is pointed at is not a slow"
#~ " way of opening a scene, it is"
#~ " a file it cannot read -- and"
#~ " PartCAD does not convert it. MJCF"
#~ " is written by ``partcad-sim-"
#~ "mujoco``'s exporter, and a file handed"
#~ " to ``pc ide open`` has no "
#~ "package around it to reach that "
#~ "exporter through. So MuJoCo is handed"
#~ " a file that already is MJCF, "
#~ "and anything else is refused with "
#~ "the export that does work (``pc "
#~ "export -S -t sim-mujoco:mjcf``, then "
#~ "open what it wrote); see `An "
#~ "engine's own scene format is its "
#~ "plugin's`_ above. What a file is, "
#~ "is its declared type, and otherwise "
#~ "its extension: PartCAD does not read "
#~ "the file to check, so an SDFormat"
#~ " world saved as ``.xml`` and opened"
#~ " with no type reaches MuJoCo, which"
#~ " reports what it cannot read. An "
#~ "ASSY scene is refused too, for a"
#~ " reason of its own -- it is "
#~ "nothing but references to the parts "
#~ "of a package, and an ad-hoc "
#~ "conversion has no package to resolve "
#~ "them against."
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "What a physical simulation actually needs"
#~ msgstr "物理仿真真正需要什么"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "URDF is the smaller half of the"
#~ " story. Gazebo does not simulate "
#~ "URDF: it converts it to `SDF "
#~ "<http://sdformat.org/>`_ on load, and SDF "
#~ "is what expresses a simulatable world."
#~ " MuJoCo's MJCF and Isaac Sim's USD"
#~ " physics schemas differ in spelling "
#~ "but ask for the same information. "
#~ "Taking the union of them, a "
#~ "simulation needs the following, and "
#~ "PartCAD today has none of it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "URDF 只是故事中较小的那一半。Gazebo 并不仿真 URDF：它在加载时把 URDF"
#~ " 转换成 `SDF <http://sdformat.org/>`_ "
#~ "，而能够表达一个可仿真世界的是 SDF。MuJoCo 的 MJCF 和 "
#~ "Isaac Sim 的 USD "
#~ "物理模式在写法上各不相同，索取的却是同样的信息。把它们取并集，一次仿真需要下面这些东西，而 PartCAD "
#~ "今天一样都没有。"

#~ msgid "Mass properties"
#~ msgstr "质量属性"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Mass, centre of mass, and the "
#~ "inertia tensor about the centre of "
#~ "mass, in a stated frame. URDF "
#~ "requires them per link and defaults "
#~ "them to zero, which makes a model"
#~ " load and then behave nonsensically -"
#~ " a zero-mass link is the single"
#~ " most common defect in published "
#~ "URDFs."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "质量、质心，以及在某个指明的坐标系中绕质心的惯性张量。URDF "
#~ "要求每个连杆都提供它们，并把默认值设为零，结果是模型能加载，随后却表现得毫无道理——零质量连杆是已发布的 URDF "
#~ "中最常见的单一缺陷。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "These are *derivable* from a solid "
#~ "plus a density, and PartCAD derives "
#~ "them: a part has a mass, a "
#~ "centre of mass and an inertia, at"
#~ " the density of the material it "
#~ "names, whether or not it states "
#~ "them, and ``pc info`` shows them. "
#~ "What is still missing is collision "
#~ "geometry and the rest below."
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "Collision geometry"
#~ msgstr "碰撞几何体"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Simulators separate the shape that is"
#~ " drawn from the shape that collides,"
#~ " because contact resolution against a "
#~ "hundred-thousand-triangle visual mesh is"
#~ " both slow and numerically ill-"
#~ "behaved. The usual answers are a "
#~ "primitive (box/cylinder/sphere/capsule), a convex"
#~ " hull, or a convex decomposition "
#~ "(V-HACD and friends). MuJoCo goes "
#~ "further and *only* collides convex "
#~ "shapes, silently taking the hull of "
#~ "anything else."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "仿真器会把用于绘制的形状和用于碰撞的形状区分开，因为针对一个十万三角面的视觉网格做接触求解既慢又在数值上表现不佳。常见的做法是使用基本体（盒/圆柱/球/胶囊）、凸包，或者凸分解（V-HACD"
#~ " 之类）。MuJoCo 走得更远，它 *只* 对凸形状做碰撞，对其他一切都会悄悄取其凸包。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "PartCAD has one shape per part. A"
#~ " part has no way to say "
#~ "\"collide me as this simpler thing\"."
#~ msgstr "PartCAD 中每个零件只有一个形状。零件没有办法声明“碰撞时请把我当作这个更简单的东西”。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Friction (isotropic and anisotropic - "
#~ "SDF's ``mu``/``mu2`` with a direction "
#~ "``fdir1``, plus torsional friction), "
#~ "restitution, contact stiffness and damping,"
#~ " slip compliance, and the solver "
#~ "knobs that go with them (``kp``, "
#~ "``kd``, ``min_depth``, ``max_vel``, ``soft_cfm``,"
#~ " ``soft_erp``). These are properties of "
#~ "a surface pairing, approximated per-body"
#~ " by every engine in use."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "摩擦（各向同性与各向异性——SDF 的 ``mu`` / ``mu2`` "
#~ "加上一个方向 ``fdir1`` ，再加上扭转摩擦）、恢复系数、接触刚度与阻尼、滑移柔度，以及与之配套的求解器旋钮（"
#~ " ``kp`` 、 ``kd`` 、 ``min_depth`` 、"
#~ " ``max_vel`` 、 ``soft_cfm`` 、 ``soft_erp``"
#~ " ）。这些本来是一对接触表面的属性，但在用的每一款引擎都把它们近似成逐刚体的属性。"

#~ msgid "Kinematics"
#~ msgstr "运动学"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The joint: its type (fixed, revolute,"
#~ " continuous, prismatic, ball, planar, "
#~ "floating, screw, universal), its axis, "
#~ "the frames on the two bodies it"
#~ " relates, its position/velocity/effort limits,"
#~ " its dynamics (damping, Coulomb friction,"
#~ " spring stiffness and reference), and "
#~ "relations between joints (``mimic``, gear "
#~ "ratios)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "关节本身：它的类型（固定 fixed、旋转 revolute、连续转动 continuous、移动"
#~ " prismatic、球铰 ball、平面 planar、浮动 floating、螺旋 "
#~ "screw、万向 "
#~ "universal）、它的轴、它所关联的两个刚体上的坐标系、它的位置/速度/力矩限位、它的动力学（阻尼、库仑摩擦、弹簧刚度与参考位置），以及关节之间的关系（"
#~ " ``mimic`` 、传动比）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "URDF is restricted to a *tree*: it"
#~ " cannot express a closed kinematic "
#~ "loop, which is why four-bar "
#~ "linkages and parallel manipulators are "
#~ "written in SDF or with an explicit"
#~ " loop-closing constraint. SDF can."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "URDF 被限制为一棵 *树* ：它无法表达闭合的运动链，这就是四连杆机构和并联机械手要么写成 "
#~ "SDF、要么靠一个显式的闭环约束来表达的原因。SDF 则可以表达。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Which joints are driven, by what, "
#~ "through which reduction, and what "
#~ "interfaces a controller sees. ROS 1 "
#~ "spelled this ``<transmission>``; ROS 2 "
#~ "spells it ``<ros2_control>`` with hardware "
#~ "components, command interfaces and state "
#~ "interfaces. Simulators additionally want "
#~ "actuator limits and often a motor "
#~ "model."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "哪些关节是被驱动的、由什么驱动、经过哪种减速，以及控制器能看到哪些接口。ROS 1 把这些写作 "
#~ "``<transmission>`` ；ROS 2 则写作 "
#~ "``<ros2_control>`` "
#~ "，其中包含硬件组件、命令接口和状态接口。仿真器还额外需要执行器的限位，而且往往还要一个电机模型。"

#~ msgid "Sensors"
#~ msgstr "传感器"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Cameras (with intrinsics, resolution, "
#~ "clipping, distortion), depth cameras, lidars"
#~ " (with ray patterns and ranges), "
#~ "IMUs, contact sensors, force-torque "
#~ "sensors - each attached to a "
#~ "*frame*, each with an update rate "
#~ "and a noise model. URDF has no "
#~ "sensor element at all; they arrive "
#~ "through ``<gazebo>`` extension blocks, which"
#~ " is the clearest evidence that URDF"
#~ " is not a simulation format so "
#~ "much as a kinematics format with a"
#~ " simulation format bolted on."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "相机（带内参、分辨率、裁剪面、畸变）、深度相机、激光雷达（带射线分布和量程）、IMU、接触传感器、力/力矩传感器——每一个都附着在某个"
#~ " *坐标系* 上，每一个都有更新频率和噪声模型。URDF 根本没有传感器元素；它们是通过 "
#~ "``<gazebo>`` 扩展块进来的，而这正是最清楚的证据：URDF "
#~ "与其说是一种仿真格式，不如说是一种外挂了仿真格式的运动学格式。"

#~ msgid "Appearance"
#~ msgstr "外观"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Colors and materials matter to "
#~ "simulation once a camera is in the"
#~ " loop: a perception stack trained in"
#~ " simulation is sensitive to albedo, "
#~ "roughness, metalness, normal maps and "
#~ "transparency. SDF and USD both carry "
#~ "a PBR material description; URDF carries"
#~ " an RGBA color and a texture "
#~ "filename."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "一旦回路中出现了相机，颜色和材质对仿真就至关重要：在仿真中训练出来的感知栈对反照率、粗糙度、金属度、法线贴图和透明度都很敏感。SDF "
#~ "和 USD 都携带一份 PBR 材质描述；URDF 携带的则是一个 "
#~ "RGBA 颜色和一个纹理文件名。"

#~ msgid "The world"
#~ msgstr "世界"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Gravity, the ground, lighting, the "
#~ "initial pose of every model, wind, "
#~ "atmosphere, and the physics engine's own"
#~ " parameters (step size, solver type "
#~ "and iteration count, contact parameters). "
#~ "This is SDF's ``<world>``, and it "
#~ "is exactly the \"scenes\" PartCAD has"
#~ " always intended to have. Gravity and"
#~ " the fluid a scene is filled "
#~ "with are the first of these a "
#~ "scene states (see `Gravity, and the "
#~ "fluid a scene is filled with`_ "
#~ "above)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "重力、地面、光照、每个模型的初始位姿、风、大气，以及物理引擎自身的参数（步长、求解器类型与迭代次数、接触参数）。这就是 SDF"
#~ " 的 ``<world>`` ，也正是 PartCAD 一直打算拥有的“场景”。"

#~ msgid "Frames"
#~ msgstr "坐标系"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Everything above hangs off named "
#~ "coordinate frames: the link frame, the"
#~ " joint frame, a tool centre point,"
#~ " a sensor mount, a grasp pose. "
#~ "SDF has explicit ``<frame>`` elements "
#~ "and poses stated ``relative_to`` them. "
#~ "PartCAD has locations, but no named "
#~ "frames to state them against."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "上面的一切都挂在具名的坐标系上：连杆坐标系、关节坐标系、工具中心点、传感器安装点、抓取位姿。SDF 有显式的 "
#~ "``<frame>`` 元素，位姿也可以用 ``relative_to`` "
#~ "相对它们来表述。PartCAD 有位置，却没有可供其参照的具名坐标系。"

#~ msgid "Proposal"
#~ msgstr "提案"

#~ msgid "Principles"
#~ msgstr "原则"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Derive what can be derived; store "
#~ "only what cannot.** PartCAD's advantage "
#~ "over a hand-written URDF is that"
#~ " it holds the actual geometry. Mass,"
#~ " centre of mass and inertia should"
#~ " be computed from the solid and "
#~ "a material, not typed in - and "
#~ "a typed-in value should be an "
#~ "explicit override that says why it "
#~ "exists (a measurement, a vendor "
#~ "datasheet, a stand-in for content "
#~ "PartCAD does not model)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**能推导的就推导，只存储推导不出来的。** PartCAD 相对于手写 URDF "
#~ "的优势在于它持有真正的几何体。质量、质心和惯性应当由实体和材料计算得出，而不是手工填写——而手工填写的值应当是一次显式的覆盖，并说明它为什么存在（一次实测、一份供应商数据表，或者是对"
#~ " PartCAD 尚未建模内容的替代）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Keep the CAD the source of "
#~ "truth.** Simulation artifacts - tessellated"
#~ " meshes, convex hulls, computed inertia "
#~ "- are derived data. They belong in"
#~ " the shape cache, content-hashed like"
#~ " every other derived shape, so that"
#~ " changing the CAD invalidates them. "
#~ "This is what the digital thread "
#~ "means here."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**让 CAD 保持为唯一可信来源。** "
#~ "仿真产物——网格化后的网格、凸包、计算出来的惯性——都是派生数据。它们属于形状缓存，像其他所有派生形状一样按内容做哈希，这样改动 "
#~ "CAD 就会让它们失效。这就是数字主线在这里的含义。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Model the concept, not the format.**"
#~ " ``mu``/``mu2`` is ODE's spelling of "
#~ "friction. PartCAD should store friction "
#~ "and let each exporter spell it. "
#~ "The formats disagree on almost "
#~ "everything except what they are trying"
#~ " to describe."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**对概念建模，而不是对格式建模。** ``mu`` / ``mu2`` 只是 "
#~ "ODE 对摩擦的写法。PartCAD "
#~ "应当存储摩擦本身，再由各个导出器去写出各自的拼法。这些格式除了想要描述的东西之外，在几乎所有方面都互不一致。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Lose loudly, never quietly.** The "
#~ "tempting version of this principle is"
#~ " \"lose nothing\": carry whatever PartCAD"
#~ " does not model as opaque, format-"
#~ "tagged passthrough so that a round "
#~ "trip is lossless long before it is"
#~ " understood. That is what ``physics:`` "
#~ "was at first, and it was the "
#~ "wrong trade. A value stored under "
#~ "the name of the format it came "
#~ "from is readable by exactly one "
#~ "exporter; it is not a property of"
#~ " the part, it is a souvenir. "
#~ "The version that survived copies each"
#~ " value into a named PartCAD property"
#~ " with a PartCAD unit, keeps the "
#~ "list of them closed, and makes the"
#~ " two failure modes loud: input "
#~ "nothing maps stops the import, and "
#~ "a property the target format cannot "
#~ "state is reported when it is "
#~ "written. A round trip is then "
#~ "lossless *and* the values mean something"
#~ " to the rest of the system. "
#~ "Everything below extends that list; none"
#~ " of it reopens the passthrough."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**要丢就大声地丢，绝不悄悄地丢。** 这条原则有一个很诱人的版本叫“什么都不丢”：把 PartCAD "
#~ "没有建模的内容当作带格式标签的不透明透传携带起来，这样早在真正理解这些内容之前，往返转换就已经无损了。 ``physics:``"
#~ " "
#~ "最初就是这么做的，而这是一笔错误的买卖。一个以其来源格式的名字存储下来的值，只有一个导出器读得懂；它不是零件的属性，而是一件纪念品。最终留存下来的版本，是把每个值复制成一个带"
#~ " PartCAD 单位的具名 PartCAD "
#~ "属性，把这份清单保持封闭，并让两种失败方式都变得响亮：无法映射的输入会中止导入，而目标格式无法表达的属性会在写出时被报告。这样一来，往返转换既是无损的，"
#~ " *同时* 这些值对系统的其他部分也有意义。下面的所有内容都是在扩充这份清单，没有一项会重新打开透传的口子。"

#~ msgid "1. Materials as first-class objects"
#~ msgstr "1. 把材料作为一等对象"

