#~ msgid "9. The property tables, and keeping them honest (in place)"
#~ msgstr "9. 属性表，以及如何让它们保持诚实（已实现）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This is the item that is built,"
#~ " and doing it first was right: "
#~ "it makes a URDF round trip nearly"
#~ " lossless while the rest of the "
#~ "proposal is still being designed, and"
#~ " it is the difference between PartCAD"
#~ " being usable in a robotics workflow"
#~ " and being a one-way trip out"
#~ " of one."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这是已经实现的那一项，而且先做它是对的：在提案的其余部分还在设计阶段时，它就让 URDF "
#~ "的往返转换接近无损；而这正是“PartCAD 能用在机器人工作流里”与“PartCAD "
#~ "只是离开这种工作流的单程票”之间的区别。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A part carries a ``properties:`` section"
#~ " holding ``material``, ``color`` and "
#~ "``physics``; an interface carries ``motion:``"
#~ " and ``physics:``. Every property in "
#~ "them is a PartCAD property with a"
#~ " PartCAD unit and a closed definition"
#~ " in the schema. A URDF import "
#~ "reads its values into them one at"
#~ " a time and the URDF export "
#~ "writes each one back into the "
#~ "element that states it. The two "
#~ "rules that keep the list honest "
#~ "are the loud failures: URDF that "
#~ "no property covers stops the import, "
#~ "and a property URDF cannot state "
#~ "is reported when the file is "
#~ "written."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "零件带有一个 ``properties:`` 小节，其中包含 ``material`` 、"
#~ " ``color`` 和 ``physics`` ；接口则带有 ``motion:``"
#~ " 和 ``physics:`` 。它们中的每一项属性都是 PartCAD 属性，带有"
#~ " PartCAD 单位，并在模式中有封闭的定义。URDF 导入会把它的各个值一项一项地读进这些属性，而 "
#~ "URDF 导出会把每一项写回到表述它的那个元素里。让这份清单保持诚实的两条规则就是那两种响亮的失败：没有任何属性能够涵盖的"
#~ " URDF 内容会中止导入，而 URDF 无法表达的属性会在写出文件时被报告。"

